---
import Sheet from '../layouts/Sheet.astro';
---
<Sheet title="Now | Diego Barros Araya" description="What Diego is working on at the moment.">
  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="n-h">
    <h1 id="n-h">Now</h1>
    <p class="mono when">2 November 2026</p>
    <p>Rebuilding this site as a technical sheet, with notes from my own knowledge base coming next. On the side, finishing the Wayland menu and popup work in the Ardour port, and keeping my NixOS machines declared in one repo.</p>
  </section>
</Sheet>

<style>
  .when { color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  p { max-width: 62ch; }
</style>
